al enchantress and  created her as a tool for chaos which is  classic Loki so the Enchantress that we  will see in Thor love and thunder could  be created by Loki depending on the  route that they go  the second villain that is being  reported to appear in Thor love and  thunder is a relatively new villain only  making his first appearance in 2013 but  definitely a fan favorite and that is  gore the god butcher gore has a pretty  tragic backstory his mother his maid and  his children all die and do  this he thinks that gods cannot exist  and due to him not thinking that gods  exist his tribe banishes him however  Gore would eventually find out that the  gods do in fact exist but the fact that  they don't help those in need such as  his dying family makes him take a vow to  kill all of the gods Gore would go on to  possess the all-black necro sword which  is a sword of insane power he gets the  necro sword from no laughter witnessing  null in combat with a golden God  according to Galactus himself the sword  carved the first dawn from the stone of  the endless night and the sword was made  using the head of a killed celestial  does that sound a little bit familiar  we've seen the severed head of a  celestial and guardians of the galaxy  volume 1 and volume 2 and now serves as  the city nowhere so perhaps this is  where Gore will end up getting the all  black necro sword and Thor at love and  thunder the all black neck restored  grants the user the ability to fly by  giving the user wings it allows the  holder to create weapons and create an  army of berserkers constructed out of  darkness but the most important part  about the all-black necro sword is that  it can kill gods  so Gore of course gets the sword and  tries to kill Thor now Thor would  ultimately go on to defeat Gore and  would banish the sword into a black hole  however King Thor would eventually need  the sword to fight Galactus and since  Marvel and Disney now own the rights to  all of the Fox character